{"id":"94fb82dfe6146007","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-formula.md","title":"Modal formula syntax","display":"df-modal-formula — Modal formula syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-formula","aliases":["72-df-modal-formula"],"display":"df-modal-formula — Modal formula syntax","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, section 2, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-formula — Modal formula syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, section 2, printed p. 477, PDF p. 489"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ZFC 元语言中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 为有序对。以下各构造产生有限语法树，不是元语言联结词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 在其出现处取自下式构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_m\">\\(\\to_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_m\">\\(\\Box_m\\)</span> 分别是对象语言蕴涵和模态构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_m\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\Box_m A\\coloneqq\\langle3,A\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_m\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\Box_m A\\coloneqq\\langle3,A\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{A\\to_m B:A,B\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in F_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{A\\to_m B:A,B\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in F_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_m A\\coloneqq A\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\n\\top_m\\coloneqq\\bot_m\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\nA\\land_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m(A\\to_m\\neg_m B),\\qquad\nA\\lor_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m A\\to_m B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_m A\\coloneqq A\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\n\\top_m\\coloneqq\\bot_m\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\nA\\land_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m(A\\to_m\\neg_m B),\\qquad\nA\\lor_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m A\\to_m B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow_m B\\coloneqq(A\\to_m B)\\land_m(B\\to_m A),\\qquad\n\\Diamond_m A\\coloneqq\\neg_m\\Box_m\\neg_m A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow_m B\\coloneqq(A\\to_m B)\\land_m(B\\to_m A),\\qquad\n\\Diamond_m A\\coloneqq\\neg_m\\Box_m\\neg_m A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书列出全部经典命题联结词；这里选蕴涵、假和方框作基础，并给出其余联结词的语法缩写。标签 0、1、2、3 使构造子互不混淆；按有限树深度递归得到唯一的公式集。已检查的来源是第 VII 章第 2 节的语言说明；标签编码是本地显式实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_m","display":false},{"tex":"p_i\\coloneqq\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\bot_m\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n(A\\to_m B)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\Box_m A\\coloneqq\\langle3,A\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"F_0\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\},\\qquad\nF_{n+1}\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{A\\to_m B:A,B\\in F_n\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m A:A\\in F_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal F_m\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_m A\\coloneqq A\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\n\\top_m\\coloneqq\\bot_m\\to_m\\bot_m,\\qquad\nA\\land_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m(A\\to_m\\neg_m B),\\qquad\nA\\lor_m B\\coloneqq\\neg_m A\\to_m B.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow_m B\\coloneqq(A\\to_m B)\\land_m(B\\to_m A),\\qquad\n\\Diamond_m A\\coloneqq\\neg_m\\Box_m\\neg_m A.","display":true}],"bytes":2067,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c7ce8536d0e2df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\operatorname{Sent}_A$、数码、环境和 $\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，标准解释关系 $\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula|df-modal-formula — Modal formula syntax]]"},{"id":"3fd94ba56d864509","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的 $\\mathcal F_m,p_i,\\bot_m,\\to_m,\\Box_m$；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的自由语法树 $\\mathcal F_m$。$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态语法。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-modal-formula|df-modal-formula — Modal formula syntax]]"}],"outgoing":[]}